# Group: gaming-32bit (optional)
# 32-bit userspace for Wine and Steam. Duplicates Mesa/Vulkan/NVIDIA libraries.
# Requires the multilib repository, which build.sh enables only for this group.
lib32-mesa
lib32-vulkan-radeon
lib32-vulkan-intel
lib32-vulkan-nouveau
lib32-nvidia-utils
# Steam itself is intentionally not pulled in: the preview image ships the
# libraries, and Steam is a large download the user should choose.
# steam
